{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "The Blue Alliance Trusted APIv1",
    "description": "# Overview\nImport FIRST Robotics Competition Data to The Blue Alliance. The API is accessed through POST requests made to the endpoints described below. To simplify the removal of incorrect data, most endpoints must be called with the full dataset. For example, there is no endpoint to add a single award-- only to update all awards. It must be called with all awards, and the ones that are no longer present will be deleted. **The exceptions are the matches, match videos, and webcasts endpoints**, which have separate endpoints to add and to delete individual items. The **event media endpoint** only allows the addition (and not the removal) of videos.\n# Authentication\nThe X-TBA-Auth-Id and X-TBA-Auth-Sig must be included as request headers in all requests. Request an auth ID and secret for your event at https://www.thebluealliance.com/request/apiwrite.\n\n*X-TBA-Auth-Id*: your auth ID\n\n*X-TBA-Auth-Sig*: `md5_hexdigest(auth_secret + request_path + request_body)`, where `request_path` is the full path starting with `/api/trusted/v1` and `request_body` is the exact body sent (empty for GET requests)\n\nFor example, an X-TBA-Auth-Sig may look like `md5_hexdigest(ExqeZK3Gbo9v95YnqmsiADzESo9HNgyhIOYSMyRpqJqYv13EazNRaDIPPJuOXrQp/api/trusted/v1/event/2014casj/matches/delete[\"qm1\"])`\n\nWhich, after hashing, becomes: `ca5c3e5c1b0e7132e4af13f805eca0be`",
    "version": "3.2.1",
    "x-changes": "3.2.1: /event/{eventKey}/media/add now rejects anything that is not an 11-character YouTube video ID with a 400. 3.2.0: Bring the spec in line with the server. Rename EventInfo `first_code` to `first_event_code`, which is the field the server reads; `first_code` was silently ignored. Type Match `score_breakdown` as a red/blue object instead of a string. Require both X-TBA-Auth-Id and X-TBA-Auth-Sig instead of either. Document the /event/{eventKey}/matches/delete_all and /event/{eventKey}/zebra_motionworks/add endpoints and the ZebraMotionWorks and ZebraTeam schemas. GET /event/{eventKey}/info returns the new EventInfoResponse schema, with `sync_disabled_flags` and full webcast objects. Document 400/401/404 causes and the Success and Error response bodies, and the `keys_deleted` response of /matches/delete. Tighten request schemas to match server validation (nullable fields, webcast type enum, `pm` comp level, required ranking fields, `qual_average`). Rename the match video and event media add operations to addMatchVideos and addEventMedia. Fix stale overview and authentication text."
  },
  "security": [
    {
      "authId": [],
      "authSig": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/event/{eventKey}/info": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Details"
        ],
        "summary": "Fetch top-level admin properties for the event",
        "description": "An endpoint to fetch the current value of the event info. This lets you fetch the current value of fields that are settable via /event/{eventKey}/info/update",
        "operationId": "getEventInfo",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EventInfoResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/info/update": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Details"
        ],
        "summary": "Update top-level properties for the event",
        "description": "An endpoint to overwrite certain event fields. All fields are optional, set only the ones you wish to update",
        "operationId": "updateEventInfo",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EventInfo"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "A JSON dictionary, mapping property name to the new value.",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/successResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/alliance_selections/update": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Alliances"
        ],
        "summary": "Update the alliance selections at an event",
        "description": "Overwrite the event's alliance selections.",
        "operationId": "updateAlliances",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AllianceList"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "A list of alliances, in order of alliance number. An alliance is a list of team keys, in order of selection. An alliance can have an arbitrary number of teams (provided that all alliances have the same number of teams).",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/successResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/awards/update": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Awards"
        ],
        "summary": "Update the award listing at an event",
        "description": "Overwrite the event's award listing.",
        "operationId": "updateAwards",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Award"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "List of awards. An award is a dict of:\n\n*name_str*: String of award name. ex: \"Tournament Winner\" or \"Dean's List Finalist\"  *type_enum*: Integer award type. Can be null, in which case it is determined from name_str.  *team_key*: String in the format `frcXXX` for the team that won the award. Can be null.  *awardee*: String corresponding to the name of an individual that won the award. Can be null. At least one of team_key or awardee must be set.",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/successResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/matches/update": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Matches"
        ],
        "summary": "Update matches at an event",
        "description": "Add/Update one or more matches under an event.",
        "operationId": "updateMatches",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Match"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "List of matches",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/successResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/matches/delete": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Matches"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete matches at an event",
        "description": "Delete one or more matches under an event.",
        "operationId": "deleteMatches",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Partial key (not including the event portion) of the match to delete",
                  "example": "qm1"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "List of match keys",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The keys of the matches that were deleted. Keys that are not valid match keys are skipped",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "keys_deleted": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "example": "qm1"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/matches/delete_all": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Matches"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete all matches at an event",
        "description": "Delete every match at an event. As a safeguard, the request body must be exactly the event key.",
        "operationId": "deleteAllMatches",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "text/plain": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "2014casj"
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "The event key, matching the `eventKey` path parameter",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/successResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/rankings/update": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Event Rankings"
        ],
        "summary": "Update team rankings at an event",
        "description": "Update rankings at an event",
        "operationId": "updateRankings",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/eventKeyParam"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "breakdowns",
                  "rankings"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "breakdowns": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "A ranking breakdown title. Breakdowns will be shown in the order given",
                      "example": "Qual Score"
                    },
                    "description": "Ranking breakdown titles, shown in the order given. `wins`, `losses`, and `ties` are removed from this list because they are already shown as the W-L-T record"
                  },
                  "rankings": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "List of dicts describing ranking data. In addition to the properties given, there should be one K/V pair for each item in the `breakdown` section (to pass game-specific ranking elements)",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "team_key": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Team key, like `frcXXXX` where `XXXX` is the team number",
                          "example": "frc254"
                        },
                        "rank": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32",
                          "description": "Integer rank of this team",
                          "example": 1
                        },
                        "wins": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32",
                          "description": "Number of non-surrogate wins",
                          "example": 4
                        },
                        "losses": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32",
                          "description": "Number of non-surrogate losses",
                          "example": 1
                        },
                        "ties": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32",
                          "description": "Number of non-surrogate ties",
                          "example": 0
                        },
                        "qual_average": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "format": "float",
                          "description": "Average qualification score, for years that rank by it",
                          "example": 85.5
                        },
                        "played": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32",
                          "description": "Number of matches played",
                          "example": 5
                        },
                        "dqs": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "format": "int32",
                          "description": "Number of non-surrogate DQ'd matches",
                          "example": 0
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "team_key",
                        "rank",
                        "played",
                        "dqs"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "description": "A dict of `breakdowns` and `rankings`",
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/successResponse"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/badRequestResponse"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/unauthorizedResponse"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/notFoundResponse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/event/{eventKey}/team_list/update": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Team List"
